<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>John Michael Quitalig – Social Media Manager</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,500;12..96,800&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;700&display=swap">
<style>
:root{--bg:#F4F5FA;--surface:#FFFFFF;--ink:#171B33;--mute:#515775;--line:#D9DCEA;--blue:#2F4BFF;--on-blue:#FFFFFF;--sun:#FFC83D;--on-sun:#171B33;--rose:#FF6F91;--on-rose:#171B33;--mint:#7FE0C3;--on-mint:#102A22;
box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){color-scheme:dark;--bg:#0F1226;--surface:#181C38;--ink:#F1F2FA;--mute:#A7ADCB;--line:#2C3158;--blue:#7C8FFF;--on-blue:#0F1226}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#0F1226;--surface:#181C38;--ink:#F1F2FA;--mute:#A7ADCB;--line:#2C3158;--blue:#7C8FFF;--on-blue:#0F1226}
html{scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);scroll-behavior:smooth}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:400 17px/1.6 "DM Sans",system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:"Bricolage Grotesque","DM Sans",system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.08;margin:0;letter-spacing:-.02em}
a{color:inherit}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:4px}
.wrap{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
header.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:22px 0}
.logo{font:800 20px "Bricolage Grotesque",sans-serif;text-decoration:none}
nav{display:flex;gap:22px;font-size:15px;font-weight:500}
nav a{text-decoration:none;color:var(--mute)}nav a:hover{color:var(--ink)}
.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:56px;align-items:center;padding:36px 0 84px}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(40px,6.4vw,76px);font-weight:800}
.hero p.lead{font-size:19px;color:var(--mute);max-width:34em;margin:22px 0 30px}
.btns{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{display:inline-block;padding:13px 22px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;font-size:16px;border:2px solid var(--ink)}
.btn.p{background:var(--blue);border-color:var(--blue);color:var(--on-blue)}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}
.btn{transition:transform .15s}
/* feed grid: the page's one bold moment */
.feed{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;background:var(--surface);padding:12px;border-radius:22px;border:1px solid var(--line)}
.feed .t{aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;overflow:hidden}
.feed .t b{font:800 clamp(15px,2.2vw,22px)/1.05 "Bricolage Grotesque",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.feed .t span{opacity:.75;font-weight:500}
.c1{background:var(--blue);color:var(--on-blue)}.c2{background:var(--sun);color:var(--on-sun)}.c3{background:var(--rose);color:var(--on-rose)}
.c4{background:var(--mint);color:var(--on-mint)}.c5{background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg)}.c6{background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);border:2px dashed var(--line)}
.feed .t.pop{animation:pop .6s both}
@keyframes pop{from{transform:scale(.8);opacity:0}to{transform:none;opacity:1}}
.feed .t:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.08s}.feed .t:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.16s}.feed .t:nth-child(4){animation-delay:.24s}.feed .t:nth-child(5){animation-delay:.32s}.feed .t:nth-child(6){animation-delay:.4s}.feed .t:nth-child(7){animation-delay:.48s}.feed .t:nth-child(8){animation-delay:.56s}.feed .t:nth-child(9){animation-delay:.64s}
section{padding:72px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
section h2{font-size:clamp(30px,4.2vw,46px);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:12px}
.sub{color:var(--mute);max-width:36em;margin:0 0 36px}
.case{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px}
.case h3{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 6px}
.case p{margin:0 0 22px;color:var(--mute)}
.case a.ext{font-weight:700}
.formats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px}
.formats .t{aspect-ratio:4/5;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;font:800 18px/1.1 "Bricolage Grotesque",sans-serif}
.cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px 36px}
.cols h3{font-size:20px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:6px;padding-top:14px;border-top:4px solid var(--blue)}
.cols p{margin:0;color:var(--mute);font-size:16px}
.tools{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}
.tools li{padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);font-weight:500;font-size:15px}
.about{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px}
.me{width:100%;max-width:300px;aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover;border-radius:24px;border:1px solid var(--line);display:block;margin:0 0 24px}
.about p{margin:0 0 16px;max-width:34em}
.contact{text-align:left}
.contact a.mail{font:800 clamp(24px,5vw,52px)/1.1 "Bricolage Grotesque",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em;word-break:break-all}
footer{padding:28px 0 44px;color:var(--mute);font-size:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
@media (max-width:820px){.hero,.case,.about{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:36px}.cols{grid-template-columns:1fr}nav{gap:14px}}
@media (max-width:480px){nav a:nth-child(n+3){display:none}.formats .t{font-size:15px;padding:10px}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.feed .t.pop{animation:none}html{scroll-behavior:auto}.btn{transition:none}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
<header class="top">
  <a class="logo" href="#top">JM Quitalig</a>
  <nav aria-label="Main"><a href="#work">Work</a><a href="#services">Services</a><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></nav>
</header>

<main id="top">
<div class="hero">
  <div>
    <h1>Social media that sounds like a person, not a brand.</h1>
    <p class="lead">I’m John Michael, a social media manager and graphic designer in Tarlac City, Philippines. I plan, design, and write Instagram content that makes complex topics easy to follow.</p>
    <div class="btns"><a class="btn p" href="#work">See my work</a><a class="btn" href="#contact">Get in touch</a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="feed" role="img" aria-label="A sample Instagram grid showing carousel, quote, and text-led post designs">
    <div class="t c1 pop"><b>Fixed or variable?</b><span>Carousel</span></div>
    <div class="t c2 pop"><b>3 questions before you apply</b><span>Checklist post</span></div>
    <div class="t c5 pop"><b>“Ask early.”</b><span>Quote card</span></div>
    <div class="t c3 pop"><b>Myth: you need 20% down</b><span>Myth vs fact</span></div>
    <div class="t c4 pop"><b>Your first home loan, simply</b><span>Reel cover</span></div>
    <div class="t c1 pop"><b>What’s a LVR?</b><span>Explainer</span></div>
    <div class="t c5 pop"><b>Client FAQ</b><span>Story highlight</span></div>
    <div class="t c2 pop"><b>Rates update</b><span>Text-led post</span></div>
    <div class="t c3 pop"><b>Book a call</b><span>Call to action</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<section id="work">
  <h2>Selected work</h2>
  <p class="sub">One brand I manage, and how I approach it.</p>
  <div class="case">
    <div>
      <h3>HL Loans, Sydney mortgage broker</h3>
      <p><strong>The challenge.</strong> Mortgages are confusing, and the broker prefers not to show his face on social media. The content has to feel personal without a person on camera.</p>
      <p><strong>What I do.</strong> I plan the monthly content calendar, design carousels and text-led posts, write captions in plain language, and review reach, saves, and follower growth to decide what to post next.</p>
      <a class="ext" href="https://www.instagram.com/hl.loans/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View @hl.loans on Instagram</a>
    </div>
    <div class="formats" aria-label="Content formats I design">
      <div class="t c1">Carousel explainers</div>
      <div class="t c2">Text-led posts</div>
      <div class="t c3">Myth vs fact</div>
      <div class="t c4">Reel covers</div>
      <div class="t c5">Quote cards</div>
      <div class="t c6">Story highlights</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="services">
  <h2>What I can do for your brand</h2>
  <p class="sub">The full loop, from idea to a post that’s live and measured.</p>
  <div class="cols">
    <div><h3>Plan</h3><p>Content calendars, post formats, and topics built around what your audience actually asks.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Create</h3><p>Graphics, carousels, and short-form video covers designed to match your brand.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Write</h3><p>Hooks and captions in plain language, with a clear next step for the reader.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Publish</h3><p>Scheduling and posting on Instagram and Facebook, with replies to comments and messages.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Measure</h3><p>Monthly review of reach, saves, and follower growth, then changes to the plan.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Build</h3><p>As an IT undergraduate I can also set up simple web pages and organise content in spreadsheets and databases.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="about">
  <h2>About me</h2>
  <div class="about">
    <div>
      <img class="me" alt="Portrait of John Michael Quitalig in a dark suit and tie" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,">
      <p>I’m an Information Technology undergraduate who got into social media through design. I’ve worked as a graphic designer and now manage Instagram content for an Australian client from the Philippines.</p>
      <p>I like clear, practical content that people can understand in a few seconds, and I’m always learning new tools.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p><strong>Tools</strong></p>
      <ul class="tools"><li>Instagram</li><li>Facebook</li><li>TikTok</li><li>Canva</li><li>Photoshop</li><li>Illustrator</li><li>Figma</li><li>Meta Business Suite</li><li>Instagram Insights</li><li>HTML &amp; CSS</li></ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact" class="contact">
  <h2>Let’s work together</h2>
  <p class="sub">I’m open to social media manager roles and freelance projects.</p>
  <a class="mail" href="mailto:johnquitalig31@gmail.com">johnquitalig31@gmail.com</a>
</section>
</main>
<footer>© 2026 John Michael Quitalig · Tarlac City, Philippines</footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
